  "system": {
    "identifier": "breath-of-water-surface",
    "description": "<p>You begin to collect and manifest water release chakra until it laces the striking portion of your weapon. The water release chakra begins to transform into streams of water, capable of being seen and felt as you then move to strike with a powerful concentrated attack.</p>\n<p>Make a single melee taijutsu attack against one creature you can see. On a hit, you deal your weapons damage + 2d12 cold damage and the target must make a strength saving throw being Dazed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: This jutsu’s attack roll cannot be made at disadvantage or with penalties to hit as a result of a condition or effect originating from a hostile creature.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d12. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher and the target of your attack has ranks of a Physical condition, you make your attack at advantage.</p>",
